{
  "title": "¿Por qué 1/2 + 1/3 no es 2/5?",
  "steps": [
    {
      "say": "Hola. En el ejercicio sumaste un medio más un tercio y te dio dos quintos. Es el error más común del salón, así que vamos a verlo juntos.",
      "draw": [
        {"op": "frac", "num": "1", "den": "2", "x": 110, "y": 100, "size": 46},
        {"op": "write", "text": "+", "x": 170, "y": 116, "size": 52, "anchor": "middle"},
        {"op": "frac", "num": "1", "den": "3", "x": 230, "y": 100, "size": 46},
        {"op": "write", "text": "=", "x": 290, "y": 116, "size": 52, "anchor": "middle"},
        {"op": "frac", "num": "2", "den": "5", "x": 350, "y": 100, "size": 46, "color": "rojo"},
        {"op": "circle", "cx": 350, "cy": 100, "rx": 46, "ry": 62, "color": "rojo"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "say": "Esta barra es un entero, como una tortilla estirada. La parto en dos pedazos iguales y pinto uno: eso es un medio.",
      "draw": [
        {"op": "bar", "x": 80, "y": 200, "w": 360, "h": 56, "parts": 2, "shade": 1, "color": "azul"},
        {"op": "frac", "num": "1", "den": "2", "x": 500, "y": 228, "size": 40, "color": "azul"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "say": "Otra barra igual, ahora partida en tres. Pinto un pedazo: eso es un tercio.",
      "draw": [
        {"op": "bar", "x": 80, "y": 290, "w": 360, "h": 56, "parts": 3, "shade": 1, "color": "verde"},
        {"op": "frac", "num": "1", "den": "3", "x": 500, "y": 318, "size": 40, "color": "verde"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "say": "Y esto son dos quintos. Mira la flecha: un medio solito ya es más grande que dos quintos. Si sumas algo, no te puede dar menos.",
      "draw": [
        {"op": "bar", "x": 80, "y": 380, "w": 360, "h": 56, "parts": 5, "shade": 2, "color": "rojo"},
        {"op": "frac", "num": "2", "den": "5", "x": 500, "y": 408, "size": 40, "color": "rojo"},
        {"op": "arrow", "x1": 260, "y1": 262, "x2": 260, "y2": 372, "color": "rojo"},
        {"op": "write", "text": "¡2/5 es menor que 1/2!", "x": 570, "y": 420, "size": 36, "color": "rojo"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "say": "El problema es que medios y tercios son pedazos de distinto tamaño. Es como sumar quetzales con dólares sin convertir. Partamos todo en pedazos iguales: sextos.",
      "draw": [
        {"op": "clear"},
        {"op": "write", "text": "Pedazos iguales: sextos", "x": 60, "y": 80, "size": 44},
        {"op": "bar", "x": 80, "y": 140, "w": 480, "h": 56, "parts": 6, "shade": 3, "color": "azul"},
        {"op": "frac", "num": "1", "den": "2", "x": 640, "y": 168, "size": 40, "color": "azul"},
        {"op": "write", "text": "=", "x": 700, "y": 184, "size": 48, "anchor": "middle"},
        {"op": "frac", "num": "3", "den": "6", "x": 760, "y": 168, "size": 40, "color": "azul"},
        {"op": "bar", "x": 80, "y": 240, "w": 480, "h": 56, "parts": 6, "shade": 2, "color": "verde"},
        {"op": "frac", "num": "1", "den": "3", "x": 640, "y": 268, "size": 40, "color": "verde"},
        {"op": "write", "text": "=", "x": 700, "y": 284, "size": 48, "anchor": "middle"},
        {"op": "frac", "num": "2", "den": "6", "x": 760, "y": 268, "size": 40, "color": "verde"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "say": "Ahora sí: tres sextos más dos sextos son cinco sextos. El número de abajo no se suma, solo dice de qué tamaño es el pedazo.",
      "draw": [
        {"op": "bar", "x": 80, "y": 360, "w": 480, "h": 56, "parts": 6, "shade": 5, "color": "morado"},
        {"op": "frac", "num": "5", "den": "6", "x": 640, "y": 388, "size": 40, "color": "morado"},
        {"op": "frac", "num": "3", "den": "6", "x": 120, "y": 510, "size": 44},
        {"op": "write", "text": "+", "x": 180, "y": 526, "size": 50, "anchor": "middle"},
        {"op": "frac", "num": "2", "den": "6", "x": 240, "y": 510, "size": 44},
        {"op": "write", "text": "=", "x": 300, "y": 526, "size": 50, "anchor": "middle"},
        {"op": "frac", "num": "5", "den": "6", "x": 360, "y": 510, "size": 44, "color": "verde"},
        {"op": "circle", "cx": 360, "cy": 510, "rx": 44, "ry": 60, "color": "verde"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "say": "Tu turno. Explícame con tus palabras por qué un medio más un tercio no puede ser dos quintos.",
      "draw": [
        {"op": "write", "text": "¿Por qué no es 2/5? Explícalo", "x": 470, "y": 530, "size": 36, "color": "azul"}
      ]
    }
  ]
}
